      "content": "that makes sense. i'll definitely look for the grade stamps. i guess i'm just worried about the stuff you can't see right away, though. like, sometimes you think a beam looks solid on the surface, but then you get it installed and it start acting up or showing issues you didn't expect. is there any way to tell if there's something \"sneaky\" going on inside the wood that could cause it to fail unexpectedly later on?",
